{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaflup's Candy Hunt is a small wacky collectathon platformer set in a forest full of mystery.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br><br>Story</strong><br>The Candenia Forest is home to many mysteries. On the Night of Spooks a small green slime meets a magic candy basket that asks for help finding candy to help save two lost villagers. In return, the candy basket gives him magical abilities to help on his journey! You'll need to find a lot of candy if you want to save Cort and Helper!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run</strong>, Jump, roll, and slam through a wacky world that consists of pieces from a 10 year catalogue of unfinished game projects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect </strong>candy and unlock new abilities to explore more of the world to collect even more candy!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Venture </strong>through 3 towers each with their own mechanics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play </strong>pinball, go platforming, or even play through a money hungry metroidvania!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet </strong>a wacky cast of characters with extremely goofy dialogue!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy </strong>cutscenes and artwork by incredibly talented members of my community!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover</strong>\u00a0unsolved mysteries of the forest.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect\u00a0</strong>silly hats to make your Leaflup have <strong><i>style</i></strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Completionist</strong>? hunt to your hearts content and complete the achievement list!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full </strong>controller support!<strong><i></i></strong>BEEMPLE!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884600?t=1753332983","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884600/f28e0e6e1d52bcd01a1dc761e635972f658a9e6d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753332983","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884600/d5b7ab10e16524ad17d61fc9be73ad2f4bc13b75/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753332983","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884600/d5b7ab10e16524ad17d61fc9be73ad2f4bc13b75/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753332983","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaflup's Candy Hunt is a small wacky collectathon platformer set in a forest full of mystery.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_parag